	(gr_text "For detailed instructions, see www.filmkorn.org\nThe Controller is powered by the Raspberry Pi.\nProjector Motor, Fan and Lamp/LED get powered via external\nPower: Use 12-36 VAC or VDC, e.g. from projector transformer.\nLED Contant Current Output can be adjusted from 1.5-32V/0-5A, \ndepending on external power supplied."
		(locked yes)
		(at 208.6864 89.662 0)
